{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaSign_eq_neg_one_iff_odd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaSign_eq_neg_one_iff_odd","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L139-L148","doc":"Bar-odd selection: the `Δ_λ` sign is `−1` iff the fake-degree valuation `n(λ)` is odd. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaSign_eq_one_iff_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaSign_eq_one_iff_even","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L128-L137","doc":"Bar-even selection: the `Δ_λ` sign is `+1` iff the fake-degree valuation `n(λ)` is even. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaValue_eq_deltaSign_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaValue_eq_deltaSign_mul","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L117-L119","doc":"**Sign projection.** the assembled value factors as sign `·` magnitude. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaValue_natAbs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaValue_natAbs","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L109-L115","doc":"**Magnitude projection.** `|Δ_λ| = dim(λ)` — the sign carrier leaves the magnitude\n(the #3537 dimension `d`) unchanged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaValue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaValue","kind":"def","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L106-L107","doc":"The assembled `Δ_λ = tr(g_ρ)` value in `ℤ`: `deltaSign λ · dim(λ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaValueRing_zeta4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaValueRing_zeta4","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L95-L104","doc":"**The assembly identity at ζ₄.** Over any `CommRing` with `i² = −1`,\n`i^{2·n(λ)}·d = (−1)^{n(λ)}·d = Δ_λ`: the graded trace `tr(g_ρ)` of the principal\ngrading, scaled by the magnitude `d`, is the ζ₄ evaluation. This is the ring-level\nstatement of `Δ_λ = tr(g_ρ) = (−1)^{n(λ)}·dim(λ)` (#3537 magnitude × #3542 sign).\nGeneric base ring per §7c. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaValueRing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaValueRing","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L90-L93","doc":"The assembled `Δ_λ = tr(g_ρ)` value over a generic base ring (§7c): the\nζ₄-evaluated principal grading `(−1)^{n(λ)}` times the magnitude `d = dim(λ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaSign_eq_neg_one_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaSign_eq_neg_one_pow","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L72-L76","doc":"**Bar-parity of the sign carrier.** `deltaSign` lands in `{+1, −1}`; combined with\n`zeta4_eval_principalGrading` this identifies it as the ζ₄ evaluation of the\njet-order (principal) grading — the bar-odd / ζ₄ fibre datum of the Δ_λ closure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaSign_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaSign_sq","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L66-L70","doc":"The sign is `±1` (its square is `1`) — it is a genuine `ℤ/2` grading value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaSign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.deltaSign","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L63-L64","doc":"The Δ_λ sign as the ζ₄-evaluated principal grading, valued in `ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.zeta4_eval_principalGrading","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.zeta4_eval_principalGrading","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L55-L61","doc":"**ζ₄ evaluation of the principal grading gives the Δ_λ sign.** Over any commutative\nring with `i² = −1`, `i^{2·n(λ)} = (−1)^{n(λ)}`. This is the algebraic core of\n`sgn(Δ_λ) = q^{2n(λ)}|_{q=i} = (−1)^{n(λ)}`: the sign is the ζ₄ (root-of-unity)\nevaluation of the principal grading. Generic base ring per §7c. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.principalGrading_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.principalGrading_single","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L51-L53","doc":"`n([n]) = 0` for a single-row shape (all boxes in row 0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.principalGrading_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.principalGrading_nil","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.principalGrading","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PrincipalGradingJetOrder.principalGrading","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PrincipalGradingJetOrder.lean#L42-L47","doc":"The principal (ρ) grading `n(λ) = Σ_i (i)·λ_{i}` (0-indexed rows) = `Σ_box row(box)`\n— the co-content / principal-specialisation exponent (`s_λ(1,q,q²,…)=q^{n(λ)}·∏…`).\nEquivalently (classical) the fake-degree valuation `min_{T∈SYT(λ)} maj(T)`; see the\nmodule docstring and `-- Ref: [macdonald1995]`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}